    {
      "id": "player_sad_short_002_01",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "大丈夫って言わなくていい。大丈夫じゃない時は、そう言っていい。",
      "translatedText": "You do not have to say you are okay. When you are not okay, you can say that.",
      "emotion": "worried",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "worried",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "player_sad_short_002_02"
    },
    {
      "id": "player_sad_short_002_02",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "私はここで聞く。急いで説明しなくてもいいから。",
      "translatedText": "I will listen here. You do not have to explain quickly.",
      "emotion": "gentle",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "gentle",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": "Stay quiet with me.",
          "nextId": "player_sad_short_002_quiet",
          "statChanges": [
            {
              "target": "player",
              "stat": "rest",
              "amount": 0.3,
              "op": "add"
            },
            {
              "target": "altera",
              "stat": "comfort",
              "amount": 0.2,
              "op": "add"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "Help me name it.",
          "nextId": "player_sad_short_002_name",
          "statChanges": [
            {
              "target": "altera",
              "stat": "trust",
              "amount": 0.2,
              "op": "add"
            },
            {
              "target": "player",
              "stat": "stress",
              "amount": -0.15,
              "op": "add"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "nextId": "player_sad_short_002_03"
    },
    {
      "id": "player_sad_short_002_quiet",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "うん。じゃあ、静かにする。置いていかない静けさにするね。",
      "translatedText": "Mm. Then I will be quiet. The kind of quiet that does not leave you behind.",
      "emotion": "soft",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "soft",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "end"
    },
    {
      "id": "player_sad_short_002_name",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "分かった。言葉にするところだけ一緒にやろう。",
      "translatedText": "Understood. Let us only do the naming part together.",
      "emotion": "gentle",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "gentle",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "player_sad_short_002_03"
    },
    {
      "id": "player_sad_short_002_03",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "一文だけでもいい。今のつらさに名前をつけるなら、何に近い？",
      "translatedText": "Even one sentence is enough. If you gave the hurt a name, what would it be closest to?",
      "emotion": "soft",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "soft",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
